  triage:title "build_runtime_status_cache_state: missing .with_recovery() on team-name parse error" ;
  triage:description "runtime_health.rs:763 — AtmError::config() for invalid team name parse in build_runtime_status_cache_state() chains .with_source(error) but not .with_recovery(). All peer error sites in the same function body chain .with_recovery(). Fix: add .with_recovery(\"Remove or rename the malformed team directory under the ATM teams root before retrying.\")." ;
